        "title": "万: Use 万 for ten thousand and numeral structure",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "万 is ten thousand. Build larger amounts by grouping around 万; do not treat the numeral as an English thousand sequence.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "一万是十个千。",
                "pinyin": "yī wàn shì shí gè qiān 。",
                "meaning": "Ten thousand is ten groups of one thousand.",
                "audio": "afc251f869169f807ffac704d1b24779e94be0c0c9e7dba3261947cda1c60032"
              },
              {
                "text": "他有两万元。",
                "pinyin": "tā yǒu liǎng wàn yuán 。",
                "meaning": "He has twenty thousand yuan.",
